ote. 'Where to?' the scholar Dr. Elena Vance asked. Morgan Steele pointed at the map's edge, past the Siberian taiga, past everything known. 'There,' Morgan Steele said.\n\nEngines up. the real treasure is the journey. The horizon, as always, was just the beginning.\n\nMorgan Steele took one last look at the Siberian taiga, green and gold and dangerous. It had given them a carved obelisk key, and taken nothing they weren't willing to give. Fair trade."}]}

